Goodix 27c6:5125 — licensing map

This repository is multi-licensed. No single blanket license applies to every
file or to the private development history.

* New project-authored userspace core and connected tools under `core/` and
  `tools/`: GPL-2.0-or-later.
* Upstream-facing driver/glue under `libfprint-driver/`:
  LGPL-2.1-or-later.
* Historical project-authored revisions released through D246 remain available
  under the BSD-2-Clause grant that accompanied those revisions. A copy is in
  `LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt`; that prior grant is not revoked.
* Third-party works retain their stated licenses. Proprietary/OEM material,
  captures, secrets and biometric data are not relicensed.

Canonical license texts are in `LICENSES/`. The operational directory map,
provenance rules and exclusions are in `docs/LICENSING_AND_PROVENANCE.md`.
